{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting Started"},"abstract":[{"text":"Setting up an Xcode project that uses MapLibre Native for iOS.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Create-a-new-iOS-project","type":"heading","text":"Create a new iOS project"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create a new (SwiftUI) iOS project with Xcode. Go to ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File > New > Project…"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Add-MapLibre-Native-as-a-dependency","type":"heading","text":"Add MapLibre Native as a dependency"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"MapLibre Native for iOS is available on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org"},{"text":" and on the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"},{"text":" (for use with the Swift Package Manager). However, for this guide we will add the MapLibre Native as a package dependency directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In Xcode, right click your project and select “Add Package Dependencies…”:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Paste the following URL and click Add Package:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"},{"type":"text","text":" repository only exists for distributing the iOS package of MapLibre Native. To report issues and ask questions, use the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native"},{"text":" repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Verify you can import MapLibre in your app:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import MapLibre"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"SwiftUI","anchor":"SwiftUI","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To use MapLibre with SwiftUI we need to create a wrapper for the UIKit view that MapLibre provides (using UIViewRepresentable. The simplest way to implement this protocol is as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct SimpleMap: UIViewRepresentable {","    func makeUIView(context _: Context) -> MLNMapView {","        let mapView = MLNMapView()","        return mapView","    }","","    func updateUIView(_: MLNMapView, context _: Context) {}","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use this view directly in a SwiftUI View hierarchy, for example:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            SimpleMap().edgesIgnoringSafeArea(.all)","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When running your app in the simulator you should be greeted with the default ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" style:","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"UIKit","level":2,"text":"UIKit","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use the following "},{"code":"UIViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to get started with MapLibre Native iOS with UIKit."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class SimpleMap: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        view.addSubview(mapView)","","        mapView.delegate = self","    }","","    \/\/ MLNMapViewDelegate method called when map has finished loading","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading _: MLNStyle) {","    }","}"]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GettingStarted"},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/gettingstarted"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"references":{"https://demotiles.maplibre.org/":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Demotiles"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","title":"Demotiles","url":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","type":"link"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AddMarkerSymbolExample":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/addmarkersymbolexample","role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Simply add a marker to a map!"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample","title":"Add Marker"},"https://swiftpackageindex.com/maplibre/maplibre-gl-native-distribution":{"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","url":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.co